  "name": "Falling Leaves (Blender add-on)",
  "summary": "Blender add-on that builds a falling-leaves scene in one click: it creates an emitter, a leaf and a collision ground, then scatters and animates leaves with physics settings (count, lifetime, size, mass, drag, rotation) and wind presets. It can import a leaf from an image and export or import simulation settings. OpenCV is bundled. It comes from the same author as the free Leaf Gen add-on.",
